<Box style={{width: 1280, height: 720, background: "#FAFAF7", padding: "28px 64px 24px", flexDirection: "column", fontFamily: "PingFang SC"}}><Box style={{height: 96, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.40)", letterSpacing: 1}}>第一幕 · 五层工程</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.25, marginTop: 10}}>这三道关不是没人想过 —— 每答一轮，答案就往外挪一层</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 532, flexDirection: "column", justifyContent: "center"}}><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", gap: 6, alignItems: "stretch"}}><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: 18, background: "rgba(28,31,35,0.035)", border: "1px dashed rgba(28,31,35,0.22)", borderRadius: 10}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 18, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>模型里面</Text><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", gap: 10, marginTop: 10}}><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: "14px 8px", background: "#FAFAF7", borderRadius: 8, alignItems: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 17, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>①</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 21, color: "#1C1F23"}}>Prompt</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 17, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.45, marginTop: 6}}>把规矩写进话里</Text></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: "14px 8px", background: "#FAFAF7", borderRadius: 8, alignItems: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 17, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>②</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 21, color: "#1C1F23"}}>Context</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 17, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.45, marginTop: 6}}>把事实塞进上下文</Text></Box></Box></Box><Box style={{width: 56, justifyContent: "center", alignItems: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 34, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>→</Text></Box><Box style={{flex: 1.3, flexDirection: "column", padding: 18, background: "rgba(15,110,86,0.07)", border: "1px solid #0F6E56", borderRadius: 10}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 18, color: "#0F6E56"}}>模型外面</Text><Box style={{flexDirection: "row", gap: 10, marginTop: 10}}><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: "14px 8px", background: "#FAFAF7", borderRadius: 8, alignItems: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 17, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>③</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 21, color: "#1C1F23"}}>Harness</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 17, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.45, marginTop: 6}}>权限 · 沙箱 · 门禁</Text></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: "14px 8px", background: "#FAFAF7", borderRadius: 8, alignItems: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 17, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>④</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 21, color: "#1C1F23"}}>Loop</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 17, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.45, marginTop: 6}}>让上次结果改变下次</Text></Box><Box style={{flex: 1, flexDirection: "column", padding: "14px 8px", background: "#FAFAF7", borderRadius: 8, alignItems: "center"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 17, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>⑤</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 21, color: "#1C1F23"}}>Graph</Text><Text style={{fontSize: 17, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.70)", lineHeight: 1.45, marginTop: 6}}>跨节点协调</Text></Box></Box></Box></Box><Text style={{fontSize: 23, fontWeight: 600, color: "#1C1F23", lineHeight: 1.5, padding: 20, background: "rgba(138,90,0,0.07)", borderRadius: 8, marginTop: 22}}>里面那两轮改的是它说什么、看到什么；只有挪到外面，才第一次碰到「这一步能不能发生」。</Text></Box><Box style={{height: 40, flexDirection: "row", justifyContent: "space-between", alignItems: "flex-end"}}><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.35)"}}>AI CODING EVOLUTION</Text><Text style={{fontFamily: "SF Mono", fontSize: 14, color: "rgba(28,31,35,0.45)"}}>04 / 37</Text></Box></Box>
